e":"dialog","args":["&越吉\n昨天杀得那些汉人屁滚尿流，真是有够\n爽快，没想到我们会这么强。\n&雅丹\n我们铁甲车天下无敌，照这样看来，\n搞不好我们可以用这个反过来吃掉中原。\n&杨兰\n要是真这么厉害，你们就不会老被姚柯回\n打得落花流水了。\n&杨兰\n昨天汉人虽败，但不过是不熟悉我们作战\n方式的结果。\n&杨兰\n若是他们发现铁甲车的秘密，我们的优势\n将不再。\n&雅丹\n你这么胆小怎么靠打仗吃饭？那些软弱\n的汉人没什么好怕的。\n&杨兰\n你还真小看汉人的狡猾。\n&杨兰\n现在天降大雪，前方地况完全不明，就算\n有布置陷阱也看不清楚。现在贸然让铁甲\n车行进简直和自杀无异。\n&越吉\n怕什么，那些汉人看到我们就吓得尿裤子\n，哪还可能有什么陷阱。\n&杨兰\n（算了，懒得理你们一群蠢猪。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[202,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,65535,0,0,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n西羌军铁甲车虽然防御力极高却没有机动\n力，只要把他们引到陷阱就可以顺利击破\n，到时伏兵会一起出现。\n&句扶\n但是如果引诱不成被追上，以我们现有的\n兵力来看会非常危险。\n&柳隐\n好啃的骨头是轮不到我们，我们消失了也\n没差，丞相的意思就是这样。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n引诱交给我一个人就好，你们两个等到\n计策成功后再前来冲杀即可。\n&句扶\n这么危险的任务怎能只交给你一个人？\n&姜维\n让伙伴去进行危险任务而自己躲在安全\n地方，这可不是我的作风。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n我把背后交给你们了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,0,0,7,18,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[3,4,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[4,3,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n这样真的好吗？这或许是个好机会。\n&句扶\n那家伙不是一般人，故意把背后留给我们\n，就表示对我们的信任。\n&句扶\n另一方面，如果我们真的背弃他，只怕\n也会被所有人唾弃。\n&柳隐\n好久没看过这么有意思的人。小句，今天\n你可完全输给他了。\n&句扶\n啰嗦！\n&句扶\n（那家伙的眼神告诉我的还不只这样，\n我认为他根本就不要命了。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[3,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[4,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,3,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,4,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[0,7,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n大汉常败军统领姜维在此前来讨战。\n&越吉\n他说什么？\n&雅丹\n汉人讲话都文诌诌的，听起来让人不爽。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n那我换个说法好了…\n&姜维\n你们这帮脑残的蛮夷废物，活著也只是\n浪费粮食的活动垃圾，快滚过来省得老子\n麻烦！\n&越吉\n这样清楚多了。\n&雅丹\n但是也让人感觉更不爽，弟兄们，给我\n打爆那个混蛋！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n好，计策成功，接下来就是将敌人引诱到\n定点就好。"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0,6,5,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n这很明显是诱敌之计。\n&雅丹\n闭嘴，老子最痛恨人家污辱我的头脑。\n&杨兰\n那么要死你们去死好了，老娘我可不想和\n你们一起陪葬。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1003]]},"end":82},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,201,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[202,201,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&越吉\n昨天杀得那些汉人屁滚尿流，真是有够\n爽快，没想到我们会这么强。\n&雅丹\n我们铁甲车天下无敌，照这样看来，\n搞不好我们可以用这个反过来吃掉中原。\n&杨兰\n要是真这么厉害，你们就不会老被姚柯回\n打得落花流水了。\n&杨兰\n昨天汉人虽败，但不过是不熟悉我们作战\n方式的结果。\n&杨兰\n若是他们发现铁甲车的秘密，我们的优势\n将不再。\n&雅丹\n你这么胆小怎么靠打仗吃饭？那些软弱\n的汉人没什么好怕的。\n&杨兰\n你还真小看汉人的狡猾。\n&杨兰\n现在天降大雪，前方地况完全不明，就算\n有布置陷阱也看不清楚。现在贸然让铁甲\n车行进简直和自杀无异。\n&越吉\n怕什么，那些汉人看到我们就吓得尿裤子\n，哪还可能有什么陷阱。\n&杨兰\n（算了，懒得理你们一群蠢猪。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[202,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,65535,0,0,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n西羌军铁甲车虽然防御力极高，但是\n攻击力却普普，就算正面交锋也不至于\n会输给他们。\n&袁綝1\n我同意，昨天若不是一时大意，怎么可能\n会输给那样笨重的部队。\n&马岱\n要是羌人光靠这样的兵器就可以称霸\n，那么怎么会后来被曹贼压制得动弹\n不得。\n&马岱\n不用担心，我军的素质远超过那些没有\n阻织的羌人。\n&马岱\n（这个姜维果然不简单，不过不知道\n为什么他似乎看我总是带有敌意？）\n&姜维\n（就算早就有心理准备，但实际见到\n马家人总还是会想起过去发生的事情。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,65535,2,0,1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n（这样真的好吗？现在或许还是个\n好机会。）\n&句扶\n（那家伙不是一般人，故意把背后留给\n我们，就表示对我们的信任。）\n&句扶\n（另一方面，如果我们真的背弃他，只怕\n也会被所有人唾弃。）\n&柳隐\n（好久没看过这么有意思的人。小句，\n今天你可完全输给他了。）\n&句扶\n（啰嗦！）"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[29]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一、全灭敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一、姜维死亡。\n二、回合数超过25。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一、全灭敌军。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n触发全部单挑。\n"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":15722,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":15724,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,27,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,822,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":15829,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[1026,3,9,10,12]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1003],[19]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&越吉\n唉呦！谁在这边挖这么大个洞。\n这下全乱了。\n&杨兰\n蠢人，中计死了也是活该。\n&姜维\n敌人中计了！伏兵们也可以出来了！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[2,65535,0,0,9,16,18,5,1,0,10,100,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,822,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&袁綝1\n我等这一天已经很久了，纳命来吧！\n&越吉\n手下败将！凭你也想打败我？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,27,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马岱\n平北将军马岱在此，不要命就过来吧。\n&雅丹\n本来以为最安全的地方现在居然也有敌人\n，我命休矣！\n（奇怪，我怎么讲话也文诌诌的。）\n&马岱\n（这个姜维果然不简单，不过不知道\n为何他总是以带有敌意眼神看我？）\n&姜维\n（就算早就有心理准备，但实际见到\n马家人总还是会想起过去发生的事情。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,4,0,4,13,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,3,0,11,13,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n开始攻击！\n&柳隐\n士兵们不要怀疑！现在是我们占优势！\n追求常败军的第一胜！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[19,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":16658,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[6,2]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[10,1003]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,201,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[201,2,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&雅丹\n你也进攻！给那些汉人致命一击。\n&杨兰\n我为什么要听你的？\n&雅丹\n拿了好处就该做事！要你们去死就得\n去死。\n&杨兰\n好吧，不过胆小的雇主也会被嘲笑的喔。\n&雅丹\n闭嘴！大不了和你一起上！"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,65535,0,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[201,65535,0,0,0,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,5,22,9,25,6,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[10,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":17063,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[822,202,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[20]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[822,202,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[202,822,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼"]},"end":28},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[822,202,13]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"这次我可大不相同！",10]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"臭小子，大话谁都会说。",0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"有本事你就过来吧，本越吉元帅可是\n西羌第一武将。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,10]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"小伙子你怕了吧！",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"龙之炎壹式“碎羽”！",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"怎么可能？汉人什么时候这么不讲\n江湖道义的？",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[38,1]},{"op":98,"name":"duel_62","args":[1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"对付卑鄙小人不用理会什么江湖道义！",1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&越吉\n我不甘心呀，若不是我没有准备好…\n&袁綝1\n吵死了！就乖乖下地狱会怎么样？"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,202,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[20,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":17745,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[27,201,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[21]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[27,201,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[201,27,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼"]},"end":27},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[27,201,13]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"",0]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"",0]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"这个旗号，莫非是马超？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"不是。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"那就好。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"不过他是我从兄，你这么想要见他？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"那还是不好，西凉马家人一个也惹不起。",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"敌前逃亡，真是可耻！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[38,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,11]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"拜托不要杀我！",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"我才懒得杀你这种废物，把你交给丞相\n发落好了。",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&雅丹\n去见丞相？好歹我也是个丞相，可以要求\n高级战俘的待遇？\n&马岱\n当俘虏脸皮还可以这么厚？"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,201,0,0,0,0,6,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[21,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":18429,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[22]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,2,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,0,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n天水姜维向敌人先锋讨战。\n\n"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n真是的，跟著那群废物就是一堆麻烦。\n"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼"]},"end":59},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[0,2,13]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"咦？羌人先锋居然是个女人？",8]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"本来懒得杀你，但既然敢看不起我，\n那就算你倒楣了。",0]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,12]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"好强，这种臂力一点也不输给男人。\n�C",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"记住这点，靠打仗维生的人，不分男\n女都会是狠脚色。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"那么就接招吧！",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"这家伙…",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,7]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"我的马居然…算了，这也毕竟是战败。\n你杀了我吧。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"像这样的胜利我才不要，下次换好马\n再好好对决吧。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"天真，战场上哪有正大光明这回事。\n你现在背对我不怕我偷袭？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"那就当作我姜维看走眼的代价。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"耍什么帅嘛，真是的。",1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n（话说回来，与其跟著彻里吉那废物，\n倒不如跟著汉人混饭吃。）\n&杨兰\n（这个人光比胆识就胜过那群垃圾了。）"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,2,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[101,65535,1,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[22,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":19788,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[0,3,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[19],[23]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,3,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[3,0,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n这场战斗居然赢了，我是在作梦吗？\n&姜维\n你们过去到底是输到什么地步？\n&柳隐\n至少背对敌人的次数比面对敌人的次数\n多。\n&姜维\n………"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[23,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":20030,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[3,4,1]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[3,0]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[36]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[3,4,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[4,3,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n既然他都有这样的表现了，我们是不是该\n试著相信那家伙？\n&句扶\n嗯…\n&柳隐\n小句，我知道夷陵之战对你造成很大的\n创伤。但还是请你要振作起来。\n&句扶\n休然，你不也是吗？你们成都柳家…\n&柳隐\n别开玩笑，那种事情我早忘了…"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[36,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":20364,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[0,4,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[19],[24]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,4,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[4,0,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n用最简单的方法获得最大的胜利，你真是\n不简单。\n&姜维\n其实昨天的败仗也并非没有贡献，就是\n因为胜利才麻痹了羌人的戒心，也才能让\n计策施行得这么顺利。\n&句扶\n（从夷陵之战以来，我一直扮演著虚伪的\n英雄，久而久之都已经变得麻木了。）\n&句扶\n（过去我放弃了一切希望，只想在这个\n常败军中得过且过，然而这个人却从来\n没有放弃希望。）\n&句扶\n（或许我也该试试看，建立一番属于自己\n的功业。）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[24,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":20849,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[2,27,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[19],[35]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[27,2,65535,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,27,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n看这名大将装扮，莫非是鼎鼎有名的\n“锦马超”？\n&马岱\n我是他族弟马岱。\n&杨兰\n原来马家人还是有幸存者，真是失敬。\n&马岱\n已经很久没看过羌人有这么雄姿英发的\n女性，如果云騄还在的话，一定会是你\n的好对手。\n&马岱\n（等一下…我看过这么多羌人，为什么\n会对这一个有这么深的印象，总觉得\n过去我在哪里看过她的样子？）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[35,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":21264,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,7,22]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[25]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[90,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[25,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":11,"offset":21337,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,8,23]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[26]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[87,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[26,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":12,"offset":21410,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[27,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[27]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马岱\n占尽优势居然还会被打倒？这真是无能。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,27,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[27,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":13,"offset":21556,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[822,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[28]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&袁綝1\n实在是无脸去永安见义父了…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,822,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[28,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":14,"offset":21693,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[2,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[29]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n（话说回来，与其跟著彻里吉那废物，\n倒不如跟著汉人混饭吃。）\n&杨兰\n（我孑然一身，要是情况不对就拍拍屁股\n跑掉就好。嗯，就这么决定了。）"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,2,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[29,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":15,"offset":21936,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[201,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[30]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&雅丹\n被俘虏的感觉还真差。"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,201,0,0,0,0,65535,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[30,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":16,"offset":22070,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[202,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[31]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&越吉\n我怎么就这样死了，\n我还没有打倒杨兰啊！"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,202,0,0,0,0,65535,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[31,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":17,"offset":22223,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[3,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[32]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&柳隐\n虽说胜败乃兵家常事，但我们总是败…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,3,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[32,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":18,"offset":22367,"title":"篗癶","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["篗癶"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[4,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[33]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句扶\n我的命运还是不能改变？"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,4,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[33,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":19,"offset":22499,"title":"�负��氦`","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["�负��氦`"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[0,7,0,2]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[0,9,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&